## Context
DESIGN.md §4 item 5, per the ratified re-form (DECISIONS.md 2026-08-26; the
political review's finding 2). The first upstream design conversation is not a
specification but an executable acceptance spec: the convergence harness, the
fold sweep, and the golden set, offered as tests he can run against whatever
he builds — the one artifact that survives reimplementation by design, aimed
at the one consistent fact about his reviews (he writes tests). Depends on
0026's buildable-now pile and 0029's fixture corpus. Terms are the commitment
bounds: this is a ONE-TIME transfer — he vendors it or it stays here; this
repo does not promise to track his tree with it.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] harness runs against stock upstream with honest red/waiver states
- [ ] offer posted upstream as one issue: what it asserts, how to run it, what
      green means, no code he has to accept
- [ ] his response recorded here; sunset rule applies (three weeks)
